  "build_notes": [
    "The Server C++ compile/link succeeded, then recursive Xcode finalization failed. Standalone ApplePostBuildSync and subsequent metadata generation succeeded; the initial failure is retained in the build stages.",
    "Engine Dawn archives warn about macOS 27.0 objects linked for minimum macOS 14.0. Runtime acceptance covers this macOS 27.0.1 host, not older deployment targets.",
    "Cooking succeeded with zero errors and four existing ACL-settings warnings in the minimal sample host.",
    "The minimal host has no OnlineSubsystemUtils IpNetDriver, so its unused gameplay listener logs a startup error. The separate RTC factory and loopback HTTP checks pass; gameplay replication is not validated.",
    "Mac ignores the requested graceful exit status for the occupied-port cases. Acceptance requires the explicit bind failure and native cleanup markers."
  ],
